WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.922
MuSc is evaluated on the two most-used industrial
benchmarks.

00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:10.253
MVTec AD spans fifteen categories, ten objects and
five textures.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:15.009
VisA covers twelve object categories across three domains.

00:00:15.089 --> 00:00:18.043
Both mix normal and defective images.

00:00:18.123 --> 00:00:21.078
Classification uses AUROC and F1-max;

00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:26.080
segmentation adds pixel-level metrics and
per-region overlap.
